{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043390/extras/73c30e8718311602c5b737fe9f6b29a5.avif?t=1774058297\" width=479 height=119 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The events unfold in a fortress in medieval Eastern Europe. The world is plunging into chaos, and you have only 10 days to prepare for the inevitable catastrophe. Every choice and every action you make will bring the fortress closer to either salvation or destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043390/extras/8a20c8da8feaf681a0a067b5478ac744.poster.avif?t=1774058297\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043390/extras/8a20c8da8feaf681a0a067b5478ac744.webm?t=1774058297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043390/extras/8a20c8da8feaf681a0a067b5478ac744.mp4?t=1774058297\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043390/extras/4dbe00681f638470981c5f22bd0b04d4.avif?t=1774058297\" width=479 height=118 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the magnate and ruler of a dying fortress, branded by a curse and tormented by alcoholism. Here, you can only rely on your decisions, your ability to manage resources, and the relationships you have built with your subjects. Time will tell whether the fortress will survive this moment or collapse along with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043390/extras/77832f3a29c635dd3110b1477e28c11b.poster.avif?t=1774058297\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043390/extras/77832f3a29c635dd3110b1477e28c11b.webm?t=1774058297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043390/extras/77832f3a29c635dd3110b1477e28c11b.mp4?t=1774058297\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043390/extras/56f2586788f88ebffa8ce3140732b408.avif?t=1774058297\" width=479 height=119 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u269c\ufe0fRelationship system: strengthen the trust of key residents of the fortress and make strategic decisions that will affect your future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u269c\ufe0fLimited help: not all residents can be helped \u2014 plan your priorities and keep track of time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u269c\ufe0fDaily visits from residents: every day brings new requests and new dilemmas. However, with power comes responsibility for the choices you make.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u269c\ufe0fResource management: keep track of supplies and money, and maintain a balance between the loyalty of the inhabitants and the level of military force in order to complete the tasks at hand and be able to defend the fortress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u269c\ufe0fCharacteristics system: at the beginning of the game, points are distributed for each parameter of the main character. In the future, they affect the available options for interacting with other characters, as well as the difficulty of mini-games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043390/extras/0634a961e0ac371df62602f9c3e3d605.poster.avif?t=1774058297\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043390/extras/0634a961e0ac371df62602f9c3e3d605.webm?t=1774058297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043390/extras/0634a961e0ac371df62602f9c3e3d605.mp4?t=1774058297\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4043390?t=1774058297","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043390/92862de55991a58a0ae7728d1560d8a7c6998532/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774058297","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043390/55661d327cf05b2123b27c343952a2a5d41d0a43/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774058297","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043390/55661d327cf05b2123b27c343952a2a5d41d0a43/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774058297","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains themes that may be sensitive for some players. It features depictions of alcohol use, references to addiction, and the harsh realities of medieval life, including poverty, suffering, disease, death, and moral dilemmas.\r\n\r\nCombat is represented through a board-game-style mini-game."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043390/extras/73c30e8718311602c5b737fe9f6b29a5.avif?t=1774058297\" width=479 height=119 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The events unfold in a fortress in medieval Eastern Europe. The world is plunging into chaos, and you have only 10 days to prepare for the inevitable catastrophe. Every choice and every action you make will bring the fortress closer to either salvation or destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043390/extras/8a20c8da8feaf681a0a067b5478ac744.poster.avif?t=1774058297\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043390/extras/8a20c8da8feaf681a0a067b5478ac744.webm?t=1774058297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043390/extras/8a20c8da8feaf681a0a067b5478ac744.mp4?t=1774058297\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043390/extras/4dbe00681f638470981c5f22bd0b04d4.avif?t=1774058297\" width=479 height=118 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the magnate and ruler of a dying fortress, branded by a curse and tormented by alcoholism. Here, you can only rely on your decisions, your ability to manage resources, and the relationships you have built with your subjects. Time will tell whether the fortress will survive this moment or collapse along with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043390/extras/77832f3a29c635dd3110b1477e28c11b.poster.avif?t=1774058297\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043390/extras/77832f3a29c635dd3110b1477e28c11b.webm?t=1774058297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=v